                            tRIOn nET sENd v1.00

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  This peace of software is Freeware and can be used with no charges, on the
      condition that the archive is spread under it's original name...

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

                                  What is it?

 TNS is a utility to send ascii files to a fidonet style network... It creates
  a echomail packet and sends it to all nodes/hubs/hosts wich are connected..

   I used Pubsend, but somehow i didn't get it working right... The messages
        have never left my bbs, so i created my own netsend utility....

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

                                 How to use it!

Create a little config file (see the demo config) in your Trion:cfg/ directory.
   This config must have the following lines in it, or else it won't work..


1. Your Node/Hub/Host number
2. Your Name
3. Your Boss number
4. To Name
5. Area Tag name
6. Subject
7. The ascii file you wish to send

      Start TNS with 'TNS <configname>' , and rest will do the trick..

